# Rust
/target/
/src-tauri/target/
/guest-helper/target/
**/*.rs.bk
# Cargo.lock IS committed — Prompt Player ships as a binary (an end product),
# not a library. Per Cargo guidance, end-product binaries pin their full
# dependency graph so CI builds are reproducible. Without this, every CI
# run picks up the latest crates and can break (e.g. `tauri 2.11.0` vs
# `@tauri-apps/api 2.10.1` minor-skew error).

